<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Social Media - Home</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: #0f0f14;
      color: #e4e4e7;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero { max-width: 600px; padding: 40px; }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7c5cff, #14b8a6);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    p { color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7c5cff, #6d4fe0);
      color: white;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.3);
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.45); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Bienvenido a Social Media 🚀</h1>
    <p>Conéctate, comparte y explora publicaciones</p>
    <a href="/posts/" class="btn">📷 Ver Posts</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>